><span begin="0:45.131" end="0:45.302">候</span> <span begin="0:45.302" end="0:45.500">也</span><span begin="0:45.500" end="0:46.289">许你还在上</span><span begin="0:46.289" end="0:46.582">学</span></p><p begin="0:46.902" end="0:49.772" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.902" end="0:48.009">大家都是同一</span><span begin="0:48.009" end="0:48.481">时间</span> <span begin="0:48.481" end="0:48.641">一</span><span begin="0:48.641" end="0:48.951">起</span><span begin="0:48.951" end="0:49.061">认</span><span begin="0:49.061" end="0:49.462">识王</span><span begin="0:49.462" end="0:49.772">勉</span></p><p begin="0:50.031" end="0:52.941" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:50.031" end="0:50.408">回想</span><span begin="0:50.408" end="0:50.767">那一</span><span begin="0:50.767" end="0:51.069">年</span><span begin="0:51.069" end="0:51.179">的</span><span begin="0:51.179" end="0:51.439">校</span><span begin="0:51.439" end="0:52.608">园生活还很悠</span><span begin="0:52.608" end="0:52.941">闲</span></p><p begin="0:53.193" end="0:56.106" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.193" end="0:53.776">是否和</span><span begin="0:53.776" end="0:54.225">我们一</span><span begin="0:54.225" end="0:55.754">样要打零工开始赚</span><span begin="0:55.754" end="0:56.106">钱</span></p><p begin="0:56.341" end="0:59.291" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.341" end="0:57.010">模仿秀</span><span begin="0:57.139" end="0:57.760">在横店</span> <span begin="0:57.950" end="0:58.150">到</span><span begin="0:58.150" end="0:58.329">义</span><span begin="0:58.329" end="0:58.620">乌</span><span begin="0:58.620" end="0:58.879">去卖</span><span begin="0:58.879" end="0:59.150">项</span><span begin="0:59.150" end="0:59.291">链</span></p><p begin="0:59.483" end="1:02.483" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.483" end="0:59.723">金</span><span begin="0:59.723" end="1:00.661">华火腿多么</span><span begin="1:00.661" end="1:01.112">好吃</span> <span begin="1:01.112" end="1:02.051">让我们一天吃</span><span begin="1:02.051" end="1:02.310">两</span><span begin="1:02.310" end="1:02.483">遍</span></p><p begin="1:02.690" end="1:05.645" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.690" end="1:04.000">回到南昌奶奶的</span><span begin="1:04.119" end="1:04.260">藕</span> <span begin="1:04.260" end="1:04.450">味</span><span begin="1:04.450" end="1:05.020">道一直都</span><span begin="1:05.020" end="1:05.270">没</span><span begin="1:05.270" end="1:05.400">有</span><span begin="1:05.400" end="1:05.645">变</span></p><p begin="1:05.645" end="1:08.820" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.645" end="1:05.809">却</span><span begin="1:05.809" end="1:07.409">没想到有两位大哥</span> <span begin="1:07.409" end="1:07.619">偷</span><span begin="1:07.619" end="1:08.820">偷跑去下饭店</span></p><p begin="1:09.041" end="1:12.002" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.041" end="1:09.379">一只</span><span begin="1:09.379" end="1:09.660">鹅</span><span begin="1:09.831" end="1:10.412">当闹钟</span> <span begin="1:10.561" end="1:10.821">吹</span><span begin="1:10.821" end="1:10.951">着</span><span begin="1:10.951" end="1:11.630">三峡</span><span begin="1:11.630" end="1:11.730">的</span><span begin="1:11.730" end="1:12.002">风</span></p><p begin="1:12.237" end="1:15.128" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.237" end="1:12.356">一</span><span begin="1:12.356" end="1:12.778">辈子</span><span begin="1:12.778" end="1:13.117">的好</span><span begin="1:13.117" end="1:13.367">朋</span><span begin="1:13.367" end="1:13.528">友</span> <span begin="1:13.528" end="1:13.756">当</span><span begin="1:13.756" end="1:14.107">然要</span><span begin="1:14.107" end="1:14.686">一起</span><span begin="1:14.686" end="1:15.128">发疯</span></p><p begin="1:15.341" end="1:18.169" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.341" end="1:16.701">体会不同的职业</span> <span begin="1:16.701" end="1:16.901">去</span><span begin="1:16.901" end="1:18.169">感受不同的人生</span></p><p begin="1:18.290" end="1:21.489" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.290" end="1:20.069">才发现每天哈哈大笑</span> <span begin="1:20.069" end="1:20.268">才</span><span begin="1:20.268" end="1:20.999">是最大的</span><span begin="1:20.999" end="1:21.489">成功</span></p><p begin="1:21.530" end="1:24.798" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.530" end="1:22.219">陪我们去</span><span begin="1:22.219" end="1:22.469">西</span><span begin="1:22.469" end="1:22.777">安吃</span><span begin="1:22.777" end="1:22.999">面</span> <span begin="1:22.999" end="1:23.189">那</span><span begin="1:23.189" end="1:24.798">时你可能已经毕业</span></p><p begin="1:24.805" end="1:27.924" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.805" end="1:25.782">还会经常怀</span><span begin="1:25.782" end="1:25.972">念和</span><span begin="1:25.972" end="1:26.354">同学</span> <span begin="1:26.354" end="1:26.583">看《</span><span begin="1:26.583" end="1:27.924">五哈》在宿舍里面</span></p><p begin="1:28.020" end="1:31.433" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.020" end="1:28.527">忘不掉</span><span begin="1:28.527" end="1:29.009">汉中</span><span begin="1:29.009" end="1:29.109">的</span><span begin="1:29.109" end="1:29.958">诗书画卷</span> <span begin="1:29.958" end="1:30.137">金</span><span begin="1:30.137" end="1:30.690">昌抓鸡</span><span begin="1:30.690" end="1:31.068">猪的</span><span begin="1:31.068" end="1:31.433">画面</span></p><p begin="1:31.560" end="1:34.439" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.560" end="1:31.689">化</span><span begin="1:31.689" end="1:32.549">成兵马俑</span><span begin="1:32.549" end="1:32.658">的</span><span begin="1:32.658" end="1:33.100">模样</span> <span begin="1:33.100" end="1:33.340">住</span><span begin="1:33.340" end="1:34.439">兵马俑的酒店</span></p><p begin="1:34.769" end="1:36.089" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.769" end="1:34.897">桐</span><span begin="1:34.897" end="1:35.128">庐</span> <span begin="1:35.238" end="1:35.498">荒</span><span begin="1:35.498" end="1:35.839">岛求</span><span begin="1:35.839" end="1:36.089">生</span></p><p begin="1:36.368" end="1:37.678" itunes:key="L22" ttm:age